cache/
__pycache__/
# output/ is generated, but two small files must ride along for the cloud
# build: a runner starts with an empty output/ and site.py copies both into
# docs/. crests.json also saves measuring 189 crests over the network on a
# cold run (his call 2026-09-12).
output/*
!output/colors.json
!output/crests.json
